Title: Sample Fountain Script
Author: Workflow Orchestrator Test Fixture

INT. COFFEE SHOP - DAY

ALICE sits at the counter, nursing a cappuccino.

ALICE
(smiling)
Another slow morning.

BOB enters, shaking rain from his coat.

BOB
You said you'd be here an hour ago.

ALICE
(teasing)
I'm here now. Isn't that enough?

They share a laugh.

EXT. STREET - CONTINUOUS

The two walk down a rain-slick boulevard, past neon-lit shop windows.

BOB
The meeting starts at noon. We can still make it.

ALICE
(checks her watch)
Then we'd better run.

They break into a jog.
